୍କାରୀମାନଙ୍କ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ଅବଜ୍ଞାରେ ଆମ୍ଭମାନଙ୍କ ପ୍ରାଣ ଅତିଶୟ ପୂର୍ଣ୍ଣ ହୋଇଅଛି।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/123.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/124.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ory_irv/PSA/122.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":4}